    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "'33\nLAKEVIEW HOTEL\nWEST LAKE\nHANGCHOW\nSunday Ayre 9\nDearrot Debs.\nI haor had a grand\nday - but hair recrnth,\nfinished my.\nsecond Chinor\nmeal - and must soon\ngo to bed. Trat ridin\nour frie auto road.\nthis Q.m with Ministe\nChu tars Chu tory+ Tai.\nViaitra the finest temple\nin all china - too glovous\nto describ or Evin try to.\nRained all day - country\npreminds me of Laker graye",
      "Worked all afternoon and\nafter dennii tonijit untie\nnow abont 1 Q.m. Must\nget up at 7 a.m. gora for\non tour tomorrow up in\nthe mountains.\nHad fine wapples for\nther (Sunday) mornin break.\nJoat Ha Ha! Not as good\nAs you cooked for me at\nBocton but ale right.\nProbabe, go back to\nShanghai tomorrow night.\ngova nigut darling\nwall with all akont\nHanychout when aft a\nChance - Lolo and Colo\no lor -\nyours Had\n2019.121.0626"
    ],
